rification hashes\n- register the report in `docs/reports/INDEX.md`\n\n## Authority and scope\n\n- exact base: `aeb033c6739a3902cca4391616d1e8000e410922`\n- PR head: `2b07fffcd311fcb1755641eba780010fd62ebc58`\n- zero provider/VLM calls\n- zero semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream writes\n- explicitly preserves the 36 `safe_rejection` denominator and denies a fully verified corpus claim\n\n## Validation\n\n- evidence index JSON parse and conservation: 16 batches; 432 papers; 3,533 questions; 3,027 `resolver_verified`; 470 `verified_agreement`; 3,497 staging; 36 `safe_rejection`\n- exact evidence audit PASS: 66 commit references, 22 merge-parent pairs, 8 freeze hashes, 64 per-batch active-hash bindings, 7 final consolidation hashes\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1694_final_consolidation.test.py`: 32/32 PASS\n- saved-evidence `issue_1694_final_consolidation.py --verify-replay` to an external temp output: PASS; 19 artifacts, 432 papers, 3,533 questions, 9,916 nodes, 3,497 verified, 36 safe rejections\n- `npm run 9709:full-corpus-freeze:test`: 23/23 PASS\n- all 53 Markdown local links resolve\n- `npm run quality:report-index`: PASS\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\n\nThe historical freeze generator's current-dependency `--check` reports its 2026-07-22 manifest stale after later mainline dependency changes. This PR does not rewrite that immutable freeze artifact; it validates the frozen output bytes/hashes directly and documents the replay boundary.","created_at":"2026-07-24T08:22:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T13:07:35Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T08:34:19Z","merged_at":"2026-07-24T08:34:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"9f7452f703fc257ab388407613e316a84316f064","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1697/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1697/comments","review_